    "zh": "分子与原子",
    "en": "Molecules & Atoms"
  },
  "desc": {
    "zh": "水烧开、水通电都是「水变了」，可一个是分子换了位置，一个是分子被拆开重组——原子不变，分子才变。",
    "en": "Boiling water and electrolysing water both “change the water”, but one only moves the molecules and the other tears them apart and rebuilds — atoms stay, molecules change."
